  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Activities with Assist-Denmark/Assist-Banglakids and partner Saraswatipur Academy (SA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of the activity is to improve the partnership relations, renew the constitution as it is an important paper in our partnership, and to improve communication skills within the organisation, to the beneficiaries as well as externally communication. 
Assist-Banglakids (A-B) and Saraswatipur Academy (SA) also aspire to get skills by exploring future visions and setting goals for new projects.
SA and A-B, plan to achieve skills to fulfil the purposes of the activities in near future.
Participants are SA-Board, employees, church workers and A-B represented by Anni and Flemming Schroeder.
The main activities are workshops in which knowledge about communication, the SA constitution, entrepreneurship, evaluation and the UN 17 Sustainable Development Goals are extended.</narrative>
  </description>
